    "body": "```suggestion\nfor i = 0 .. 1:\n    // Even halfword: subtract\n    a_even = s1[(32*i+15):(32*i)]\n    b_odd = s2[(32*i+31):(32*i+16)]\n    d[(32*i+15):(32*i)] = a_even - b_odd\n\n    // Odd halfword: add\n    a_odd = s1[(32*i+31):(32*i+16)]\n    b_even = s2[(32*i+15):(32*i)]\n    d[(32*i+31):(32*i+16)] = a_odd + b_even\n```",
